    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43659" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐδιά-χῠτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easily dissolved</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρμακα ὑπὸ τῶν κοιλιῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					864a29
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					3.2.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>easily diffused</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Placit.</u>
					4.13.11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>flexible</i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>easily relieved</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ὄρεξιν εὐ. ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Sent.</u>
					26
				</span></i>
			.</div>
